<h2><span lang="EN-GB">Datuming</span></h2>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-left:19px;"><img src="properties_files/datuming.gif" width="151px" height="159px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Datuming group</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Group</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– number of datum entities in this group.</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Common</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– name and type of the group, and total extents and size of all datum entities in this group.</span></p>
