<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Datum Point entity</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Point</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– co-ordinates of the point. Their values are editable.</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Common</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– name and type of the entity, and its extents and size. Size is always zero.</span></p>
