<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Datum Plane entity</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Plane</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– co-ordinates of the plane centre, plane normal, and distance from the beginning of the global co-ordinate system to the plane centre. Their values are editable.</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Common</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– name and type of the entity, and its extents and size.</span></p>
