<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Circle</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– co-ordinates of the circle center, its radius, and normal of the plane where circle lies. Their values are editable.</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Common</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– name and type of the entity, and its extents and size.</span></p>
