<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Cone</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– co-ordinates of the apex and base centre, its radius, direction and length of the axis, apex angle, and the radius. Their values are editable.</span></p>
